===

[Audit]: The trust should audit its defences.

[Hazards harm unless defended]: "Hazards bring harm unless the defences hold."
    {fidelity: "quotation", causes: {from: hazard, to: harm, sign: "+", basis: asserted, unless: defence}}
    +> [Audit]

[Audits strengthen defences]: "Audits keep the defences in place."
    {fidelity: "quotation", causes: {from: audit, to: defence, sign: "+", basis: asserted}}
    +> [Audit]

[Harm despite culture]: "Harm came about despite a reporting culture, where no audit was made."
    {fidelity: "quotation", causes: {from: hazard, to: harm, sign: "+", basis: example, despite: culture, given: [{state: audit, value: "absent"}]}}
    +> [Audit]

[No harm among the trained]: "Among trained staff, hazards did no harm."
    {fidelity: "quotation", causes: {from: hazard, to: harm, sign: "0", basis: study, given: ["among trained staff"]}}
    +> [Audit]
